  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 cup finely crushed buttery crackers (such as Ritz®)",
    "0.5 teaspoon garlic powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon seafood seasoning (such as Old Bay®)",
    "2 tablespoons butter, melted",
    "1 pound sea scallops, patted dry",
    "cooking spray"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/x5UEFo0lPQKwWyeWXv7iuXt34W4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/278032_AirFryerBreadedSeaScallops_Ingredients_Step1_1905-a64e8f1e6e374c608216bd89a5ccf1a5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/278032/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the air fryer to 390 degrees F (198 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Mix cracker crumbs, garlic powder, and seafood seasoning together in a shallow bowl. Place melted butter in a second shallow bowl.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/jhlFRkghA6bqqXIJbrMeYRnTT2M=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/278032_AirFryerBreadedSeaScallops_Step2_1906-2d50cdcae02d4090b9f4087bf39edc92.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/278032/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dip each scallop in melted butter, then roll in the breading until completely coated. Set on a plate and repeat with remaining scallops.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6EMncb-albqbMw25MfeQDekHlpY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/278032_AirFryerBreadedSeaScallops_Step3_1908-e79be99cc8274480a7276b4c8587f40d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/278032/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Lightly spray the air fryer basket with cooking spray. Arrange scallops in the prepared basket so that they are not touching each other; you may need to work in batches.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/lkKwvyXMSi6EKgYEq7Id2pbV_qE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/278032_AirFryerBreadedSeaScallops_Step4_1914-da2e3fcc777f46d4bc8816f29f26dffd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/278032/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cook in the preheated air fryer for 2 minutes. Turn scallops over gently with a small spatula and cook until opaque, about 2 more minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aG17AM58XR5qUBTBy0oJFdvQPlI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/278032_AirFryerBreadedSeaScallops_Step5_1954-bfac3ea38c984fa0a2abeb3d11aa66e2.jpg"
